#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:5 797cf581ddbe4d41bf4e9e29a61b115f
msgid "SkyRocket Software"
msgstr "SkyRocket软件"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:7 e731fdf39e874f61a2b6bcf05ee799a6
msgid ""
"the drone shipped with a custom version of ArduPilot (Copter) which is close"
" to Copter-3.5 but now additional features (notch filter, etc).  `GitHub "
"repo is here <https://github.com/SkyRocketToys/ardupilot>`__ in the "
"skyviper-stable branch."
msgstr ""
"该飞行器出厂时搭载自定义版本的ArduPilot（Copter），接近Copter-3.5但现增加了额外功能（陷波滤波器等）。`GitHub仓库在此 "
"<https://github.com/SkyRocketToys/ardupilot>`__ 在skyviper-stable分支。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:8 99279425b3bd48c8b9090df610d5fca9
msgid ""
"firmware source for the video board is `here "
"<https://github.com/SkyRocketToys/Sonix>`__"
msgstr "视频板固件源码在 `此处 <https://github.com/SkyRocketToys/Sonix>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:9 5b5300ce185c40b7bb0f849952719a8b
msgid ""
"`APWeb <https://github.com/ArduPilot/APWeb>`__ (a tiny open source web "
"server) runs on the drone and allows easy calibration, modification of "
"parameters, uploading firmware to both the drone and transmitter, "
"downloading log files, pictures and videos."
msgstr ""
"`APWeb "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/APWeb>`__（一个小型开源Web服务器）运行在飞行器上，支持简便的校准、参数修改、向飞行器和遥控器上传固件，以及下载日志文件、图片和视频。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:10
#: ff3a6b4741484382832d3dc9b5897da1
msgid ""
"the transmitter has a relatively low powered STM8 processor running open "
"source software written by Tridge (incorporates some code from Paparazzi).  "
"`Github repo is here <https://github.com/SkyRocketToys/STM8TX>`__."
msgstr ""
"遥控器搭载相对低功耗的STM8处理器，运行由Tridge编写的开源软件（含部分来自Paparazzi的代码）。`Github仓库在此 "
"<https://github.com/SkyRocketToys/STM8TX>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:11
#: b1cc5553f1d041e9a831942a0297126a
msgid "live video can be viewed through a SkyRocket app or Mission Planner."
msgstr "实时视频可通过SkyRocket应用或 Mission Planner 查看。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:14
#: 33d8b224cbc74bf792d769dab2adef17
msgid "Uploading alternative firmware"
msgstr "上传备用固件"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:19
#: 0077b59e03e4413eaa450fa403c78664
msgid ""
"The instructions below describe how to uploading alternative firmware to the"
" drone.  Normally we recommend users stick with the official firmware from "
"SkyRocket but for those interested in trying the very latest features from "
"ArduPilot, participating in beta testing or for those who wish to create "
"their own custom firmware, these instructions are useful."
msgstr ""
"以下说明介绍如何向飞行器上传备用固件。通常我们建议用户坚持使用SkyRocket的官方固件，但对于有兴趣尝试ArduPilot最新功能、参与beta测试或希望创建自定义固件的用户，这些说明非常有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:21
#: 25bd3cc86f644f14823deb964d8bf9c0
msgid ""
"Note that alternative firmwares are use **at your own risk** and probably "
"void your warranty."
msgstr "请注意，使用备用固件**需自担风险**，可能会使保修失效。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:23
#: 99df33caa1594d00a4b0525e2e982883
msgid "**Which firmware to use?**"
msgstr "**使用哪个固件？**"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:25
#: 8b0d896fb0484efcab36b3e9a2e75db9
msgid "As of early 2018 there are two versions of the firmware available:"
msgstr "截至2018年初，有两个版本的固件可用："

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:27
#: c8a450c4b64c41c09da7cc377c0abca4
msgid ""
"the `official firmware from skyrocket <http://firmware.sky-"
"viper.com/latest/>`__ (see file ending with \".abin\") is the safest "
"firmware to use."
msgstr ""
"`skyrocket官方固件 <http://firmware.sky-"
"viper.com/latest/>`__（查找以\".abin\"结尾的文件）是最安全的固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:28
#: c08e813a5c764235826f8549d5813735
msgid ""
"the `latest firmware from ArduPilot "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/latest/skyviper-v2450/>`__ includes "
"some new features (i.e. :ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>`) but is also missing"
" some features (i.e. ability to control vehicle during RTL)."
msgstr ""
"`ArduPilot最新固件 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/latest/skyviper-v2450/>`__ 包含一些新功能（如 "
":ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>`），但也缺少一些功能（如RTL期间控制飞行器的能力）。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:30
#: d8bfdc57efe14fc194fe3029b24cbdf9
msgid "**Uploading using the SD card**"
msgstr "**通过SD卡上传**"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:32
#: 6fb3d82f24d741e3b6dcbe4e367c1fc1
msgid ""
"powerdown the drone and remove the SD card from the back of the skyviper and"
" insert into your PC (an SD card adapter may be required)"
msgstr "关闭飞行器，从skyviper背面取出SD卡并插入PC（可能需要SD卡适配器）"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:33
#: 571f3c92443d4bfcb9eb98afc00ef484
msgid ""
"copy the firmware into the top directory of the SD card and then rename it "
"to \"flight_fw.abin\""
msgstr "将固件复制到SD卡的根目录，然后将其重命名为\"flight_fw.abin\""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:38
#: fbb4cf921f5b45c69a39767b96ef56b3
msgid "place the sd card back into the drone and power up the vehicle"
msgstr "将SD卡重新插入飞行器并启动"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:39
#: a20a351bde7148f089a31c7a38637b9e
msgid ""
"after about a minute the LEDs should flash and the vehicle should reconnect "
"to the transmitter"
msgstr "大约一分钟后，LED应闪烁，飞行器应重新连接到遥控器"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:41
#: 2f640bd1cc364e4a805ce17b123429fe
msgid "**Uploading using APWeb**"
msgstr "**通过APWeb上传**"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:43
#: a504053a94f84975ab43f1c42c7dc33a
msgid ""
"from your PC, connect to the SkyViper wifi access point (normally called "
"\"SKYVIPERGPS-xxxxxx\", password is \"vipergps\")"
msgstr "从PC连接到SkyViper WiFi接入点（通常名为\"SKYVIPERGPS-xxxxxx\"，密码为\"vipergps\"）"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:44
#: 3ed995dee82a48e5a0c9eb85def13010
msgid ""
"open a web browser to ``http://192.168.99.1`` and click the **Upgrade "
"Firmware** link"
msgstr "打开浏览器访问 ``http://192.168.99.1`` 并点击**Upgrade Firmware**链接"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:49
#: 3cc9c6ccb95a42e6baf38f163d548691
msgid ""
"in the \"Upgrade ArduPilot Firmware\" section, push the \"Browse\" button "
"and select the \\*.abin file downloaded above"
msgstr "在\"Upgrade ArduPilot Firmware\"部分，点击\"Browse\"按钮并选择上面下载的\\*.abin文件"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:50
#: 54bf12677f574b878e5a8662c65d94ab
msgid ""
"push the \"Upload File\" button and wait a minute or two.  The green bar at "
"the top of the web page should crawl from left to right and then the "
"autopilot should reboot and reconnect to the transmitter"
msgstr "点击\"Upload File\"按钮，等待一两分钟。网页顶部的绿色进度条应从左向右爬过，然后飞控应重启并重新连接到遥控器"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:57
#: 6b36ae85f17f4023983e75b37411d155
msgid ""
"After a firmware upgrade it may be necessary to perform an accelerometer "
"calibration.  This can be done from the web interface's \"Calibration\" "
"page."
msgstr "固件升级后可能需要进行加速度计校准。这可以通过Web界面的\"Calibration\"页面完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:59
#: aecfef58ce50485bad5c376ee59f7ffd
msgid "**When things go wrong**"
msgstr "**遇到问题时**"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:61
#: 8d9261e25cbd42f18f916cdae1fdc78a
msgid ""
"If the drone becomes unresponsive or will not connect to the transmitter or "
"the wifi access point does not appear, don't worry, it is nearly impossible "
"to \"brick\" the skyviper.  Try these steps:"
msgstr "如果飞行器无响应、无法连接到遥控器或WiFi接入点未出现，不必担心，skyviper几乎不可能被\"变砖\"。请尝试以下步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:63
#: 892d72b98f4145c1ac02d201e8a6c9ad
msgid ""
"download the official skyrocket firmware from `here <http://firmware.sky-"
"viper.com/latest/>`__ (look for the file ending with \".abin\")."
msgstr ""
"从 `此处 <http://firmware.sky-viper.com/latest/>`__ "
"下载skyrocket官方固件（查找以\".abin\"结尾的文件）。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:64
#: 72c2b54c74e243e89cbdd24012b0c1c2
msgid ""
"use the \"Uploading using the SD card\" method above to upload the firmware "
"to the drone"
msgstr "使用上述\"通过SD卡上传\"方法将固件上传到飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:65
#: 55fca62097364ce9ac3113d7840bb3be
msgid ""
"if this does not work, try asking for help in the `SkyViper section of the "
"ArduPilot forum <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/arducopter/skyviper>`__"
msgstr ""
"如果仍不起作用，请在 `ArduPilot论坛的SkyViper板块 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/arducopter/skyviper>`__ 寻求帮助"
